    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūnīla Falao",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lwa kwandya ng'weji gw'ikūmi n'ībīlī, ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'ībīlī, mhayo go ng'wa Seeba gūkanizīīla gūlīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, tūlaga ng'hūngū kūlwa ng'wa Falao ntemi wa Misili, ūng'wīle:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyī yene ng'hūngū ya kūtūmamīlwa kwīlīla Misili; bashīke ba mahanga ga banhū bakwītūmamīla, bakwītūmamīla kwīlīla ī Misili na a mabità gayo pye a gose; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lwikūmi n'itanò lwa ng'weji, ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'ībīlī, mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūkanizīīla gūlīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, līlaga ng'hūngū kūlwa mabità ga Misili, ūgalugalīle mu gatī ya sī kū bafu, gabize ng'wenūmo na a bashīke ba kūfuma mu mahanga a ga nguzu, nī ligelè lya baja ng'wichongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage, “A bing'we hū mubakīlile a bangī ū būsoga? Ikagi kūlimu mukalambalale hamò na banhū batasaalilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo bakūgwa, babize ū ng'wigelè lya babo baabūlagwa bo līlūshū. Nīyo ī haha ī līlūshū līlīng'waaje; n'adutanjiagwe na a mabità gakwe pye a gose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gatī ya shigila balīmo a basugi ba nguzu bakwīhayaga ī Misili na a babo baal'isangī līmò nayo; balīhaya, ‘Nabo biza hasī kūlambalala na banhū batasaalilwe, banhū abo baabūlagwa bo līlūshū.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Ashulu īlī kwenūko nī libità lyayo ī lyose, īpīndiwe shigila sha bafu bayo; pye abo baabūlagwa bo līlūshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shigila shabo shilī mu shimu mu gatī y'ichongo, nī libità lyayo līlambalalile kūshipīndīlīja ī shigila shayo. Pye abo baalī na lyogohya mu shikū ja būpanga wabo balī kwenūko, baagwishiwa līlūshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Elamu īlī kwenūko, na a mabità gayo gashipīndije ī shigila shayo, pye a bose baabūlagwa, baagwishiwa līlūshū. Pye abo baalī na lyogohya mu shikū ja būpanga wabo balī mu gatī ya sī kū bafu, baaja batasaalilwe; balī kwenūko na magooke gabo, balī ng'wigelè lya baja ng'wichongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wambīlwa būlīīlī ū mu bafu, hamò na a mabità gakwe a gose kūshipīndīlīja ī shigila shakwe; pye a benaba batasaalilwe, baabūlagwa bo līlūshū. Īkī ū mu shikū ja būpanga wabo ī lyogohya lyabo lyalī lyīsambaalīla hose pyī ū mu sī, ī haha balī ng'wigelè lya baja ng'wichongo, balambalalile ng'wenūmo hamò na bafu; bakūkoyaga na magooke gabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balīko koi na ba Mesheki na Tubali, na a mabità gabo gashipīndije ī shigila shabo; pye batasaalilwe. Baabūlagwa bo līlūshū kūlwa nguno ū mu shikū ja būpanga wabo, ī lyogohya lyabo baalī baalīsambaaja hose pyī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī batalambalalile hamò na a bashilikale a bangī abo batasaalilwe, abo baacha būponyiwa mu shigila hamò na shilanga shabo sha būlūgū, nī shū jabo jūtūūlwa kū mitwe yabo būjiisagūja? Ū nsango gwa shibi shabo gūgikalīlile a maguha gabo nūūlū īkī ī lyogohya lyabo lyalī lyīsambaalīla pyī ī sī ū mu shikū ja būpanga wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū bebe Falao ūkūbīnzagūka, ūkūlambalala ū mu batasaalilwe, hamò na a babo baabūlagwa bo līlūshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī Edomu īlīho, na a batemi bayo na a basugi, abo nūūlū īkī baalī na būdūla alīyo ī haha balambalalile hamò nabo abo baabūlagwa bo līlūshū. Balambalalile na banhū batasaalilwe, hamò na baja ng'wichongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a basugi ba sī ja sukuma na a Basidoni balīko koi; baaja nūūlū īkī baalī na lyogohya nguno ya būdūla wabo, balī ū ng'wigelè lya bafu bachile soni. Balīko batasaalilwe, bakūkoyaga na magooke gabo balambalalile hamò na baja ng'wichongo abo baabūlagwa bo līlūshū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, “Ū Falao nī libità lyakwe ī lyose ūlū ūbabona koi akūlūngūja ū ng'wiyanga lya bashilikale bakwe a bose, abo baabūlaagwa bo līlūshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū īkī ū mu shikū ja būpanga bokwe naalī nanzunīlīja ī lyogohya lyakwe līsambaale hose pyī ū mu sī, alīyo nang'hwe akūlambalala nī libità lyakwe, isangīje na banhū batasaalilwe, abo baabūlagwa bo līlūshū; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
